     1|/**
     2| * IVX Reels — full-screen vertical video feed matching ivxholding.com exactly.
     3| *
     4| * Same backend the landing page uses:
     5| *   feed      → GET /api/ivx/video-platform/feed
     6| *   like      → POST /api/projects/:id/like
     7| *   save      → POST /api/projects/:id/save
     8| *   share     → POST /api/projects/:id/share
     9| *   follow    → POST /api/ivx/video-platform/follow
    10| *   report    → POST /api/ivx/video-platform/videos/:id/report
    11| *   comments  → GET/POST /api/projects/:id/comments
    12| *
    13| * Player lifecycle (Instagram-style):
    14| *   • Only ONE reel plays at a time (the active/index item)
    15| *   • Max 3 players mounted (active ± 1) — all others unmounted
    16| *   • Pauses on app background, screen unfocus, network disconnect
    17| *   • 80% viewability threshold to prevent overlap during fast scroll
    18| *   • Per-item error boundary so one bad video never crashes the feed
    19| */
    20|import React, { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useRef, useState } from 'react';
    21|import {
